Package: dhcp-gui
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Section: net
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Franco Conidi <fconidi@gmail.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, pkexec | policykit-1, kea-dhcp4-server, iproute2
Description: Graphical manager for the Kea DHCPv4 server
 Dhcp-GUI configures and manages the Kea DHCPv4 server installed on this
 computer: subnet, address pool, gateway, DNS, static reservations and PXE
 options, with a preview of the change, backup and automatic restore if a change
 fails. Changes are made by a small helper authorized through polkit.
